WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.165
When a colleague remembers the day but not the number, switch the queue to Timeline and match the date group and ticket title.

00:00:07.165 --> 00:00:14.895
Open the candidate and read Activity for the event, actor and time, rather than treating the report date as the time of the repair.

00:00:14.895 --> 00:00:19.165
Use Details to confirm the studio and equipment before quoting that history.
